4d8ed914b0f62ebc3d9f7830b1f1988f10a21a411d7f5164802bce9b153b07a5","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":13},{"dia_id":"D5:14","global_turn_index":100,"locator":"[S5T14]","raw_turn_sha256":"e871252774c0be6961b579a60c7163fc7474295871f1da2f2ee5672adcf8cd4c","rendered_turn_sha256":"19c95846f3d58109c5673ab9f61a4d3ade334d202716352745d047b69da9b791","session_date":"2023-05-03","session_datetime":"2023-05-03T13:16:00","session_id":"session_5","session_index":5,"source_sha256":"44c364190392e074eaf3fdd3230c179205b93723dea32f252927d76f71c62f95","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":14},{"dia_id":"D5:15","global_turn_index":101,"locator":"[S5T15]","raw_turn_sha256":"abbcd602be04d4f34196bdfb3255a5396c32888a8832ba1276e61fcdaa530f77","rendered_turn_sha256":"54744b26318c8d1048e979362dde9c30ab175c7419386929e15cc19eb8b110e6","session_date":"2023-05-03","session_datetime":"2023-05-03T13:16:00","session_id":"session_5","session_index":5,"source_sha256":"0e7eff8a113fbfa312df7ea504503711b358883f18315e03ecab1d2de4df850d","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":15}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-04-20, continued the catch-up: offered to show Calvin around Boston (Paradise Rock, House of Blues, Fenway Park), said he'll be in the front row when Calvin performs, and agreed to grab food at his favorite spots when Calvin visits (details in ## Boston) [S3T10][S3T15][S3T16]. Calvin shared a photo of his red sports car on display at a show, and Dave praised the work put into it [S3T13][S3T14].\n- On 2023-05-01, caught up with Calvin (\"long time no see\") and announced that he had finally opened his own car maintenance shop — a dream come true and a step toward his other dream of working on classic cars; shared a photo of the shop (including a group of people in front of a car) and of the engine of the classic car he restored in 2022, and invited Calvin to come by; Calvin congratulated him, the conversation closed with mutual encouragement, and Calvin shared a photo of a gold necklace with a diamond pendant (details in ## Car maintenance shop, ## Classic cars, and /memories/calvin.md) [S4T1][S4T5][S4T7][S4T15][S4T16][S4T17][S4T22][S4T23][S4T24].\n- On 2023-05-01, complimented Calvin's necklace and asked where he got it (Calvin: a gift from another artist, a reminder of why he keeps hustling as a musician); encouraged Calvin to keep pushing and making music, and the two agreed to keep each other motivated — \"the road can be hard, but when we remember why we're doing it, it keeps us going\" (in Calvin's words) [S4T25][S4T26][S4T27][S4T28].\n- On 2023-05-03, reconnected with Calvin (\"long time no talk\") and announced the team-up with the local garage; Calvin congratulated him on \"this new venture\", called it \"super inspiring\" and \"impressive how far [Dave has] come since [they] last chatted\", asked about his plans for next, and encouraged him not to forget to relax and enjoy the process; the two also swapped how they unwind — Calvin: long drives in his red sports car (details in ## Car maintenance shop, ## Classic cars, and /memories/calvin.md) [S5T1][S5T2][S5T3][S5T4][S5T6][S5T7][S5T8].\n- Later in the 2023-05-03 conversation: agreed with Calvin that driving with the wind in your hair, and walking around to explore the sights and sounds of nature, are calming [S5T9]; when Calvin said his music is stuck (\"creativity's frozen\"), gave him the creative-block tip (see ## Music) and encouraged Calvin to keep pursuing his music and never give up [S5T10][S5T11][S5T13]; the two said goodbye and agreed to keep in touch, with Dave saying Calvin can let him know if he ever needs help [S5T14][S5T15].","text_sha256":"629395e6a7a42c47b140848fd9f09161fcac36d580f1f9dcd308af80d5630a36","timestamp":null},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D4:24"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":185,"line_st