ng Dave's work (\"Keep up the great work!\" / \"Keep on keepin' on, bud!\") after Dave said his work is valued and brings joy to others; Calvin then shared a photo of a gold necklace with a diamond pendant (see ## Jewelry) [S4T22][S4T23][S4T24].\n- On 2023-05-03, reconnected with Dave (\"long time no talk\") and congratulated him on teaming up with a local garage — \"super inspiring seeing [Dave] follow [his] passion\", \"congratulations on this new venture\", \"impressive how far [Dave has] come since [they] last chatted\"; called the car Dave was working on \"awesome\" with \"a lot of effort\" behind it, asked about his plans for next, cheered on Dave's dream of building a custom car (\"sounds awesome\"), and told him to relax and enjoy the process; when Dave asked how he unwinds, said long drives in his red sports car help him relax (details in ## New luxury car (Ferrari, 2023-03-26) and /memories/dave.md) [S5T1][S5T2][S5T3][S5T4][S5T6][S5T7][S5T8].\n- The 2023-05-03 conversation ended with Calvin thanking Dave for the creativity advice (\"taking a break is great for getting my mojo back\"), saying he won't give up, and \"let's stay in touch\"; Dave encouraged him to keep pursuing his music and said Calvin can reach out anytime if he needs help [S5T12][S5T13][S5T14][S5T15].","text_sha256":"11b38e58ab10bfcb2a511c67f89e0b0f317e1df5d1d992989da3e48d753790ee","timestamp":null}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","pre_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":617,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":19971,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":20588},"model":{"requested_model":"coding","served_models":["qwen3.8:27b"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"60d0c608bdda6e13c46a9e6cbf4cd7cae4f7eea8